---
source: src/cli/env_spec.rs
expression: "summarise(&t, &[\"sbxenv.yaml\", \"local.yaml\"])"
---
ENVIRONMENT
  Name:   web-app
  Files:  <root>/proj/sbxenv.yaml
          <root>/proj/local.yaml

SANDBOX
  + web-app
      agent: claude
      sandboxOptions.memory: 8g
      sandboxOptions.cpus: 4

KITS
  + org/tool
  + org/pinned
      args.region: us

WORKSPACES
  + <root>/proj/web
      clone: true
  + <root>/proj/docs
      readOnly: true

MOUNTS
  + <root>/proj/cache -> /home/agent/.cache

ENV
  + LOG_LEVEL
      value: debug
  + NODE_ENV
      value: development

SECRETS
  + github
      command: gh auth token
      workdir: fresh host temporary directory
  + google
      ref: op://vault/item/field
  + openai
      value: sha256:1eaa840f0577b0dbef7d091e41827c315610880057abaffd31736cac13356010

PORTS
  + 3000/tcp4
      host: 3000
  + 53/udp
      host: ephemeral

  13 to add · 0 to change · 0 to destroy
  ! this plan runs commands on this machine, outside the sandbox, with your own privileges
